==============================================================================================================
  [PASS] C1  the transformation r = rho (1 + b/(4 rho))^2 gives EXACTLY f = 1 - b/r = [(1 - b/4rho)/(1 + b/4rho)]^2 -- the standard Schwarzschild isotropic map, which here is INDEPENDENT of the JNW exponent s and of the conformal factor A(phi)
           (f(rho) = (b - 4*rho)**2/(b + 4*rho)**2)
